# Files the Vercel CLI must never upload (frontend-devops-conventions.md
# § Secrets Integration). The deploy workflows upload a clean checkout, so
# this guards a manual `vercel deploy` from a working copy.

# Local-only docs and brief (CLAUDE.md § Local-only files)
docs/
/Kybr — frontend.md

# Env files: deployed values live in Vercel's environment variables
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output, dependencies, test and tool artifacts
.next/
node_modules/
coverage/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
test-results/
.lighthouseci/
.claude/
